Dialogue: 3,0:07:03.53,0:07:09.28,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}COLUMBUS, GA. CAMPAIGN
Dialogue: 3,0:07:03.53,0:07:09.28,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1961 · COMMUNICABLE DISEASE CENTER
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.63,0:07:42.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Since 2000, the only polio vaccine used in the U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.18,0:07:45.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}has been the inactivated one, given as a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.39,0:07:48.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The CDC notes that because it's made from killed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.73,0:07:50.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}virus, it cannot cause polio.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:38.88,0:07:44.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 870 0 l 870 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:38.88,0:07:44.63,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:38.88,0:07:44.63,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}OPERATION ALLIES WELCOME · VACCINES INCLUDED POLIO
Dialogue: 3,0:07:38.88,0:07:44.63,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}U.S. NAVY IMMUNIZATION SITE · 2021
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.02,0:08:22.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}But there weren't machines to do the pushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.37,0:08:24.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}So people did it by hand, squeezing a bag, in
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.73,0:08:26.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}shifts, around the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.03,0:08:28.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Some accounts put the number of medical and dental
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.65,0:08:31.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}students who took part at more than a thousand.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:20.27,0:08:26.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 805 0 l 805 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:20.27,0:08:26.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:20.27,0:08:26.02,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}BAMC 2022 · VENTILATOR TRAINING, TANZANIA 2026
Dialogue: 3,0:08:20.27,0:08:26.02,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}MODERN TRAINING FOOTAGE · NOT 1952
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:45.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Harvard Medical School says iron lungs eventually
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.23,0:08:46.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}became obsolete.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.32,0:08:49.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Today, intensive care units like these, at U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.52,0:08:52.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Naval Hospital Guam, use mechanical ventilators.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:42.13,0:08:47.88,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 717 0 l 717 132 l 0 132{\p0}
