Dialogue: 3,0:08:42.13,0:08:47.88,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ICU VIRTUAL TOUR · EMPTY ROOMS
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.24,0:08:56.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And here, an Air Force respiratory care practitioner
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.92,0:09:00.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}teaches Tanzanian military medical staff to use
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.24,0:09:03.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}ventilators, during a training exercise in 2026.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:53.49,0:08:59.24,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 953 0 l 953 132 l 0 132{\p0}
