Dialogue: 3,0:08:53.49,0:08:59.24,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}DAR ES SALAAM, TANZANIA · MARCH 2026
Dialogue: 3,0:08:53.49,0:08:59.24,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}VENTILATOR TRAINING · JUSTIFIED ACCORD 26
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.38,0:09:57.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Not with the iron lung.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.96,0:10:00.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The machine kept people alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.02,0:10:01.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It could not stop the virus.
