Dialogue: 3,0:09:56.63,0:10:02.35,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1945 · U.S. ARMY SIGNAL CORPS
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.32,0:10:13.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And the crisis the iron lung couldn't handle helped
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.36,0:10:15.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}give us the modern intensive care unit.
